    "sourceUrl" : "",
    "body" : "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1729897860001\" id=\"item-671c25756bf199389f36e750\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-3261311293848eca223c\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>About us</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Property Media Japan specialises in Real Estate Photography, Videography, Aerial Photography, Floor-plans and Virtual Staging. Previously based in Queenstown New Zealand, we are now operating in Niseko, Hokkaido Japan.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-image image-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.imageLayout/2879e00d-19b4-4cbc-98a7-b216cfa11d78_235/website.components.imageLayout.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.imageLayout/2879e00d-19b4-4cbc-98a7-b216cfa11d78_235/website.components.imageLayout.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.imageLayout\" data-sqsp-block=\"image-classic\" data-website-component-id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1729835254380_173374\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1729835254380_173374\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n  <div\n    class=\"\n      image-block-outer-wrapper\n      layout-caption-below\n      design-layout-inline\n      combination-animation-none\n      individual-animation-none\n      individual-text-animation-none\n    \"\n    data-test=\"image-block-inline-outer-wrapper\"\n    data-sqsp-image-classic-block-layout=\"inline\"\n    style=\"--image-component-focal-point: 50% 50%;--image-component-object-fit: cover;\"\n  >\n\n    \n\n    \n\n    \n      <figure\n        class=\"sqs-block-image-figure intrinsic\"\n        style=\"max-width:1131px;\"\n      >\n        \n      \n        \n          \n      <div\n        \n        \n        class=\"image-block-wrapper\"\n        data-animation-role=\"image\"\n        \n  \n\n      >\n        <div\n          data-sqsp-image-classic-block-image-container\n          class=\"sqs-image-shape-container-element js-image-container\n            \n            \n          \"\n          \n          style=\"\n            position: relative;\n            padding-bottom:141.4677276611328%;\n            overflow: hidden;-webkit-mask-image: -webkit-radial-gradient(white, black);\n          \"\n        >\n          \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          \n          <img data-stretch=\"false\"\n  data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/38164d88-97e5-47ca-b8d5-ddd48dd2f2be/floor+plan+toru+apartments+Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer.jpg\"\n  data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/38164d88-97e5-47ca-b8d5-ddd48dd2f2be/floor+plan+toru+apartments+Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer.jpg\"\n  data-image-dimensions=\"1131x1600\"\n  data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\"\n  data-sqsp-image-classic-block-image\n  alt=\"\"\n  data-licensed-asset-preview=\"false\"\n  data-load=\"false\" elementtiming=\"system-image-block\" src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/38164d88-97e5-47ca-b8d5-ddd48dd2f2be/floor+plan+toru+apartments+Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer.jpg\" width=\"1131\" height=\"1600\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 767px) 100.00vw, 100.00vw\" style=\"display:block;object-position: var(--image-component-focal-point);object-fit: var(--image-component-object-fit);\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/38164d88-97e5-47ca-b8d5-ddd48dd2f2be/floor+plan+toru+apartments+Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer.jpg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/38164d88-97e5-47ca-b8d5-ddd48dd2f2be/floor+plan+toru+apartments+Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer.jpg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/38164d88-97e5-47ca-b8d5-ddd48dd2f2be/floor+plan+toru+apartments+Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer.jpg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/38164d88-97e5-47ca-b8d5-ddd48dd2f2be/floor+plan+toru+apartments+Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer.jpg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/38164d88-97e5-47ca-b8d5-ddd48dd2f2be/floor+plan+toru+apartments+Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer.jpg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/38164d88-97e5-47ca-b8d5-ddd48dd2f2be/floor+plan+toru+apartments+Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer.jpg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/38164d88-97e5-47ca-b8d5-ddd48dd2f2be/floor+plan+toru+apartments+Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer.jpg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-loader=\"sqs\" data-image-component=\"1.0.1\">\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    \n        \n      \n\n      \n        <figcaption\n          data-sqsp-image-classic-block-caption-container\n          \n          class=\"image-caption-wrapper\"\n        >\n          <div class=\"image-caption\"></div>\n        </figcaption>\n      \n    \n      </figure>\n    \n\n    \n\n\n  </div>\n\n  \n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1729835254380_174163\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">This sleek, newly-built apartment located in Toru Apartments offers modern living in one of Queenstown\u2019a most sought-after areas. With a bright, open-plan living and dining area, this 1-bedroom, 1-bathroom unit features a contemporary design perfect for those seeking comfort and style.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The kitchen boasts state-of-the-art appliances, stone countertops, and ample storage, providing a functional yet stylish space for all your culinary needs. The spacious bedroom offers tranquility, complemented by soft natural light and minimalist d\u00E9cor.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The apartment includes a modern bathroom with a walk-in shower, heated towel rail, and laundry facilities for added convenience. Ideal for those who enjoy the outdoors, the living area opens up to a private balcony with stunning views of the surrounding landscapes.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Located just minutes from Niseko\u2019s world-renowned ski resorts and local amenities, this property is ideal for those looking to enjoy the best of both worlds\u2014luxury and convenience. While there is no private garage, the apartment offers designated parking for residents.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Perfect for professionals, couples, or as an investment property, this unit promises comfort and sophistication in the heart of Niseko</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block gallery-block sqs-block-gallery\" data-block-json=\"&#123;&quot;existingGallery&quot;:null,&quot;hSize&quot;:null,&quot;newWindow&quot;:false,&quot;floatDir&quot;:null,&quot;methodOption&quot;:&quot;transient&quot;,&quot;aspectRatio&quot;:null,&quot;auto-crop&quot;:true,&quot;blockAnimation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;collectionId&quot;:&quot;671c2815f12799182bad6b51&quot;,&quot;design&quot;:&quot;stacked&quot;,&quot;show-meta&quot;:true,&quot;show-meta-basic&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-title&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-description&quot;:false,&quot;square-thumbs&quot;:true,&quot;vSize&quot;:null,&quot;transientGalleryId&quot;:&quot;671c2815f12799182bad6b51&quot;&#125;\" data-block-type=\"8\" data-sqsp-block=\"gallery\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1729835254380_184060\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n<div class=\"\n  sqs-gallery-container\n  sqs-gallery-block-stacked\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  block-animation-none\n  clear\"\n  \n  \n>\n  <div class=\"sqs-gallery\">\n    \n      \n        \n          <div class=\"image-wrapper\" id=\"671c2858067788331ebc3115\" data-type=\"image\" data-animation-role=\"image\">\n            \n              <noscript><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1729898586698-E94YK8B2IGB1EWMOX94C/toru+apartments+Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer+%2812%29.jpg\" alt=\"toru apartments Niseko Kutchan Hokkaido Japan Real Estate Property Agent Photographer Videographer (12).jpg\" /></noscript><img class=\"thumb-image\" elementtiming=\"system-gallery-block-stacked\" data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1729898586698-E94YK8B2IGB1EWMOX94C/toru+apartments+Niseko+Kutch